\">\n<div class=\"gf-rapid-num\"><span class=\"qs-n\">1</span><span class=\"qs-ok\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg></span></div>\n<div><div class=\"gf-rapid-label\"><span class=\"qs-when-active\">Now</span><span class=\"qs-when-locked\">Next</span><span class=\"qs-when-done\">Complete</span></div><h3>Your details</h3><p>Our team of engineers may have follow up questions to fully understand your requirements.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gf-rapid-step qs-guide\" data-guide=\"2\" data-state=\"locked\">\n<div class=\"gf-rapid-num\"><span class=\"qs-n\">2</span><span class=\"qs-ok\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg></span></div>\n<div><div class=\"gf-rapid-label\"><span class=\"qs-when-active\">Now</span><span class=\"qs-when-locked\">Next</span><span class=\"qs-when-done\">Complete</span></div><h3>Describe your project</h3><p>Please provide as much information as possible to help us respond accurately. This may include material details and dimensions, quantities and timing, regulatory requirements and application.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gf-rapid-step qs-guide\" data-guide=\"3\" data-state=\"locked\">\n<div class=\"gf-rapid-num\"><span class=\"qs-n\">3</span><span class=\"qs-ok\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg></span></div>\n<div><div class=\"gf-rapid-label\"><span class=\"qs-when-active\">Now</span><span class=\"qs-when-locked\">Next</span><span class=\"qs-when-done\">Complete</span></div><h3>Upload your file